{"id":"ccbc16:puzzle:5","answer":"SAD ROBOT","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>每个机器人头都是一种插头；不同插头有不同的字母编号。</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-cae4293237c51012d2e1071b\" src=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/94c5ccc065354f388b124ce9a83258b4.webp\"/></p>","text":"每个机器人头都是一种插头；不同插头有不同的字母编号。","assetIds":["asset-cae4293237c51012d2e1071b"]},{"number":2,"title":"该如何理解等式的意义","html":"<p>等式的意义是把字母按照 A=1, B=2, ..., Z=26 的规则转换成数字，进行相加后再转回字母。</p>\n<p>例如 A + D = 1 + 4 = 5 = E。</p>","text":"等式的意义是把字母按照 A=1, B=2, ..., Z=26 的规则转换成数字，进行相加后再转回字母。\n\n例如 A + D = 1 + 4 = 5 = E。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>每个机器人头其实是一种电源插座。不同的电源插座有不同的字母编号，先找到每个机器人头对应的字母编号，如果有两个头，则按示例将它们的A1Z26值相加再转回字母，得到答案 <code>SAD ROBOT</code>。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"image\" data-asset-id=\"asset-b4ea22acbd5ee4d82c932a17\" src=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/4f1c22adcb5a4cbb93131b01676c0579.webp\"/></p>","text":"每个机器人头其实是一种电源插座。不同的电源插座有不同的字母编号，先找到每个机器人头对应的字母编号，如果有两个头，则按示例将它们的A1Z26值相加再转回字母，得到答案\nSAD ROBOT\n。","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-b4ea22acbd5ee4d82c932a17"]},"extended":{"html":"","text":"","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{"html":"<p>机器人法则示例：A+D=B+C=E</p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/50e3514aee46415c9b840ac5e8df0448.webp\" class=\"pimg\">\n<style>\n.pimg {\n    width: 800px;\n}\n@media (max-width: 940px) {\n    .pimg {\n        width: 100%;\n    }\n}\n</style>"},"sourceMetadata":{"type":1,"answer_type":0,"extend_data":"{\"pid\":5,\"imgUrl\":\"c00c0ebb79ed4abd944ce00984c819f2.webp\",\"color\":\"#000\",\"top\":\"320px\",\"left\":\"452px\"}","pgid":1,"pg_name":"序章","resolved_extend_assets":["https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/c00c0ebb79ed4abd944ce00984c819f2.webp"]},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-454055c76649a03c871668c4","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/c00c0ebb79ed4abd944ce00984c819f2.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/c00c0ebb79ed4abd944ce00984c819f2.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":5752,"sha256":"d28bf500606b992996d2814f7cb2bd03308a6d664b63164a04678f8685fdf277","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["sourceMetadata"]},{"id":"asset-b4ea22acbd5ee4d82c932a17","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/4f1c22adcb5a4cbb93131b01676c0579.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/4f1c22adcb5a4cbb93131b01676c0579.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":158534,"sha256":"5012b8cc1481ed807fefff849229b84dea9a6e82a60801463cc016c4cbe0ed6b","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]},{"id":"asset-cae4293237c51012d2e1071b","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/94c5ccc065354f388b124ce9a83258b4.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/94c5ccc065354f388b124ce9a83258b4.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":24830,"sha256":"2d68a06509f6522b547a4d342f550a2c964a475e761baed3d1f866de27c78bb7","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["hint:1"]},{"id":"asset-e9732aea938297ed48054539","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/50e3514aee46415c9b840ac5e8df0448.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/50e3514aee46415c9b840ac5e8df0448.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":197844,"sha256":"e525d7b15910984c14478384240c543c157cb8d88fdd742337b9e4de1d81e02e","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["interactive"]}]}
